nt of Intelligence.\n\nWhen Dark Seer levels up, he restores a percentage of his max health and mana.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["int_to_atkspd", "attack_speed_tooltip", "heal_pct"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "mana_gain", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "dark_seer_wall_of_replica", "name_zh": "黑暗贤者·复制之墙", "name_en": "Wall of Replica", "description_zh": "制造一堵扭曲的光墙，对穿过的敌方英雄造成伤害和减速，并复制一个其自身的幻象，幻象由黑暗贤者控制，持续到光墙消失，或者被敌人消灭。", "description_en": "Raises a wall of warping light that slows, damages, and creates replicas of any enemy hero who crosses it. Enemy replicas serve at the Dark Seer's will. Replicas last until they are destroyed, or until the wall's duration ends.", "notes_zh": ["幻象不会产生幻象。", "每堵光墙同一时间产生的为一名英雄产生的幻象只有一个。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "replica_damage_outgoing", "tooltip_outgoing", "replica_damage_incoming", "tooltip_replica_total_damage_incoming", "width", "movement_slow", "slow_duration", "scepter_length_multiplier", "wall_damage", "cooldown_reduction", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "illusions", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "clinkz_searing_arrows", "name_zh": "克林克兹·灼热之箭", "name_en": "Searing Arrows", "description_zh": "让克林克兹的箭矢带有火焰，造成更多伤害。骷髅弓手在攻击克林克兹的攻击目标时会发射灼热之箭，造成%skeleton_damage_pct%%%伤害。", "description_en": "Imbues Clinkz's arrows with fire for extra damage.Skeleton Archers will fire Searing Arrows at targets Clinkz attacks for %skeleton_damage_pct%%% damage.", "notes_zh": ["灼热之箭能对建筑造成伤害。", "伤害直接作为物理伤害加到克林克兹的攻击伤害中。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_bonus", "has_multishot", "skeleton_damage_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "clinkz_death_pact", "name_zh": "克林克兹·死亡契约", "name_en": "Death Pact", "description_zh": "克林克兹以敌方非英雄单位或友方骷髅弓手为吞噬的目标，治疗并获得最大生命值。不会使克林克兹脱离骨隐步。", "description_en": "Clinkz consumes the target enemy creep or friendly Skeleton Archer, healing and gaining max health. Does not take Clinkz out of Skeleton Walk.", "notes_zh": ["如果目标是敌方单位，克林克兹将获得经验和金钱。", "克林克兹的当前血量和生命值上限都将提高。", "持续时间结束后，血量上限回到正常值，但是当前生命值不变（不会高于血量上限）。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "health_gain", "spawn_skeleton_on_origin", "creep_level", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "clinkz_burning_barrage", "name_zh": "克林克兹·炽烈火雨", "name_en": "Burning Barrage", "description_zh": "持续施法 - 克林克兹持续施法，朝目标方向射出多支灼热的箭矢，击中所有敌人，造成克林克兹攻击伤害的一定百分比并施加攻击特效。", "description_en": "CHANNELED - Clinkz channels and shoots multiple piercing arrows in the target direction that hit all enemy units dealing a percentage of Clinkz' attack damage and applying attack modifiers.", "notes_zh": ["攻击距离加成会提升炽烈火雨的长度。"], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["wave_count", "range", "damage_pct", "projectile_width", "AbilityChannelTime", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "clinkz_wind_walk", "name_zh": "克林克兹·骨隐步", "name_en": "Skeleton Walk", "description_zh": "克林克兹进入隐身状态，移动可以穿过其他单位，攻击或使用物品时现形。脱离隐身后会产生骷髅弓手。骷髅弓手不能移动，需要多次英雄或防御塔攻击才会被击杀。骷髅弓手继承克林克兹一定百分比的攻击力，对建筑造成的伤害降低%skeleton_building_damage_reduction%%%。攻击距离与克林克兹相同。", "description_en": "Clinkz moves invisibly through units until the moment he attacks or uses items. Leaving Skeleton Walk creates Skeleton Archers.Skeleton Archers are immobile and die within multiple attacks from a hero or tower. Skeleton Archers deal a percentage of Clinkz' damage, and deal %skeleton_building_damage_reduction%%% less damage to buildings. Attack range is equal to Clinkz' attack range.", "notes_zh": ["渐隐时间为%fade_time%秒。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "fade_time", "move_speed_bonus_pct", "skeleton_count", "skeleton_offset", "skeleton_offset_min", "skeleton_duration", "skeleton_health", "skeleton_health_tooltip", "skeleton_building_damage_reduction", "attack_rate", "damage_percent", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "damage_block", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "invisibility", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "clinkz_infernal_shred", "name_zh": "克林克兹·地狱之裂", "name_en": "Infernal Shred", "description_zh": "克林克兹和他的骷髅弓手会施加一个可叠加的负面效果，使他们的攻击可以穿透最高目标%max_armor_piercing_pct%%%总物理护甲（不会降低他们的护甲）。克林克兹每次攻击施加%hero_stacks%%%，骷髅弓手施加%skeleton_stacks%%%。持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Clinkz and his skeletons apply a stacking debuff that causes their attacks to pierce up to %max_armor_piercing_pct%%% of the target's total physical armor (does not reduce their armor).  Clinkz applies %hero_stacks%%% per attack, and skeletons apply %skeleton_stacks%%%. Lasts %duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["duration", "hero_stacks", "skeleton_stacks", "max_armor_piercing_pct"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "armor_reduction", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "omniknight_purification", "name_zh": "全能骑士·洗礼", "name_en": "Purification", "description_zh": "立即治疗一个友方单位，并对周围的敌军造成伤害。", "description_en": "Instantly heals a friendly unit and damages all nearby enemy units.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "%recast_delay%秒延迟后目标会再次受到%recast_effectiveness_pct%%%威力的洗礼。", "en": "After a %recast_delay%s delay, the target is Purified again with %recast_effectiveness_pct%%% effectiveness."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["heal", "radius", "recast_delay", "recast_effectiveness_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "omniknight_martyr", "name_zh": "全能骑士·驱逐", "name_en": "Repel", "description_zh": "提供减益免疫状态和%magic_resist%%%魔法抗性，以及额外生命恢复。", "description_en": "Grants Debuff Immunity with %magic_resist%%% magic resistance, as well as bonus HP Regen.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["base_hpregen", "duration", "magic_resist", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "debuff_immunity", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "omniknight_hammer_of_purity", "name_zh": "全能骑士·纯洁之锤", "name_en": "Hammer of Purity", "description_zh": "全能骑士将神圣之力注入他的战锤，使他的攻击距离提升，会根据基础攻击力的一定百分比造成纯粹伤害，并且使目标短时间内被减速。全能骑士会在%heal_duration%秒内回复%heal_pct%%%造成的伤害。", "description_en": "Omniknight imbues his hammer with holy power, causing his attack to have increased range, deal pure damage based on a percentage of his base damage and slow his target for a short duration. Omniknight heals for %heal_pct%%% of the damage dealt over %heal_duration%s.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["base_damage", "bonus_damage", "heal_pct", "heal_duration", "total_ticks", "attack_cooldown", "attack_range_bonus", "duration", "movement_slow", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "omniknight_degen_aura", "name_zh": "全能骑士·退化光环", "name_en": "Degen Aura", "description_zh": "削弱过于靠近的敌方单位的移动能力，降低其移动速度。", "description_en": "Degenerates the movement capabilities of enemy units that stray too near, slowing their movement speed.", "notes_zh": ["对减益免疫单位无效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["speed_bonus", "radius", "linger_duration"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aura", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "omniknight_guardian_angel", "name_zh": "全能骑士·守护天使", "name_en": "Guardian Angel", "description_zh": "全能骑士召唤出守护天使，使全能骑士附近的所有友方单位对物理伤害免疫。", "description_en": "Omniknight calls upon a Guardian Angel that grants immunity from physical damage to all allied units near Omniknight.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "守护天使的作用范围为全地图，影响建筑并增强生命回复。", "en": "Guardian Angel has global radius, affects buildings, and amplifies health restoration."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "radius", "is_global", "affects_buildings", "heal_and_regen_amp", "model_scale", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "summons", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_impetus", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·推进", "name_en": "Impetus", "description_zh": "激活后每次攻击都有附魔效果，根据与目标的距离造成额外伤害。目标越远，伤害越高。对幻象造成双倍伤害。", "description_en": "Places an enchantment on each attack while activated, causing it to deal additional damage based on how far away the target is.  The farther the target, the greater the damage dealt. Deals double damage to illusions.", "notes_zh": ["造成伤害上限的距离是%distance_cap%。", "计算与目标之间的距离在攻击弹道击中目标时。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["distance_damage_pct", "distance_cap", "illusion_damage_multiplier", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_enchant", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·魅惑", "name_en": "Enchant", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女诱惑一个敌人。如果目标是英雄，将被驱散，其移动速度也会被减缓，持续%slow_duration%秒，而魅惑魔女和她的单位攻击目标时拥有额外攻击距离。\n\n如果目标是非英雄单位，魅惑魔女会将其控制，并获得%xp_gain_pct%%%相应的击杀经验。魅惑魔女控制的非英雄单位最多持续%dominate_duration%秒。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Enchantress charms an enemy. If the enemy is a hero, they are dispelled and slowed for %slow_duration%s, and Enchantress and her units gain bonus attack range against the target.\n\n If the enemy is a creep, she brings it under her control and receives %xp_gain_pct%%% of their experience bounty.  Enchantress can control creeps for up to %dominate_duration%s. \n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": ["可以转化幻象。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "魅惑魔女可以同时控制多个非英雄单位。", "en": "Enchantress can control multiple creeps at a time."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["slow_movement_speed", "slow_duration", "attack_range_bonus", "dominate_duration", "enchant_health", "enchant_damage", "xp_gain_pct", "level_req", "max_creeps", "bonus_armor", "bonus_health", "bonus_damage", "bonus_attackspeed", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "economy", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "summons", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_natures_attendants", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·自然之助", "name_en": "Nature's Attendants", "description_zh": "召唤一群小精灵治疗魅惑魔女以及身边的友方单位。", "description_en": "A cloud of wisps heals Enchantress and any friendly units nearby.", "notes_zh": ["不会选择满血单位进行治疗。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["heal_duration", "heal_interval", "heal", "radius", "wisp_count", "movespeed", "total_max_heal", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "healing", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_bunny_hop", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·跃动", "name_en": "Sproink", "description_zh": "向后跳跃，躲避多种飞行过程中的攻击和技能弹道，并向魅惑魔女的攻击距离+%bonus_attack_range%范围内最远的%attack_targets%个敌方单位发动一次附有推进的攻击。", "description_en": "Leaps backward, dodges incoming projectiles, and launches an Impetus attack on the %attack_targets% furthest enemy units within Enchantress' attack range + %bonus_attack_range%.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "shard", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["hop_distance", "hop_duration", "hop_height", "attack_targets", "bonus_attack_range", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "flying", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "projectile_dodge", "condition": "shard"}, {"mechanism": "self_mobility", "condition": "shard"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_little_friends", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·密友", "name_en": "Little Friends", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女缠绕一个敌方单位。目标附近所有敌方、友方和中立非英雄单位会攻击魅惑魔女选定的目标，并且具有攻击速度和移动速度加成，持续%duration%秒。", "description_en": "Enchantress roots an enemy unit. All creeps, ally, enemy and neutral within a radius will gain bonus movement and attack speed and attack the chosen target for %duration% seconds.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "scepter", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "bonus_attack_speed", "bonus_move_speed", "radius", "root_base_duration", "root_per_target", "max_root", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "forced_action", "condition": "scepter"}, {"mechanism": "root", "condition": "scepter"}]}, {"subject": "enchantress_untouchable", "name_zh": "魅惑魔女·不可侵犯", "name_en": "Untouchable", "description_zh": "魅惑魔女让她的敌人神魂颠倒，受到他们攻击时会降低其攻击速度。", "description_en": "Enchantress beguiles her enemies, slowing their attacks when she is attacked.", "notes_zh": ["所有直接攻击魅惑魔女的敌方单位都会被减速。", "减速效果在攻击单位产生攻击动作时出现，而不是伤害生效时。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["slow_attack_speed", "slow_duration"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "slow", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "huskar_inner_fire", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·心炎", "name_en": "Inner Fire", "description_zh": "在炽烈的狂暴下将附近所有敌人击退至固定距离外，造成伤害和沉默。", "description_en": "In a fiery rage, knocks all nearby enemies away from you to a fixed distance, dealing damage and silencing them.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["health_cost", "damage", "radius", "disarm_duration", "knockback_distance", "min_knockback_distance", "knockback_duration", "min_knockback_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCooldown"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "displace_other", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "silence", "condition": "base"}]}, {"subject": "huskar_burning_spear", "name_zh": "哈斯卡·沸血之矛", "name_en": "Burning Spear", "description_zh": "哈斯卡将其长矛点燃，在普通攻击的同时对敌方单位造成持续伤害。多次攻击会造成持续伤害叠加。每次攻击都将牺牲哈斯卡部分生命值。", "description_en": "Huskar sets his spears aflame, dealing damage over time with his regular attack.  Multiple attacks will stack additional damage.  Each attack drains some of Huskar's health.", "notes_zh": ["沸血之矛在多次施放到目标身上效果可以叠加。没有叠加上限。", "哈斯卡不能使用此技能自杀。", "炙矛可热不会对肉山造成额外的最大生命值烧灼伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["max_health_cost", "burn_damage", "burn_damage_max_pct", "duration", "AbilityCastRange"], "judge": [{"mechanism": "aoe_damage", "condition": "base"}, {"mechanism": "attack_modifier", "condition": "base"}]}]}
